## Load samples after keyboard events finish {#sample-browser-events}
tech: one-shot timer for browser confirmation, cancellation and focus changes
files: [PakettiLoadSampleBrowser.lua, features/sample-browser-deferred-close.feature, features/sample-browser-deferred-close.session.md]

- [x] Defer browser loading and closure and reject duplicate requests {#sample-browser-deferred-close}
  by: codex
  from: agent

- [x] Restore octave and toggle shortcuts and load selected folders with Shift–Enter {#sample-browser-folder-shortcuts}
  by: codex
  from: agent

- [x] Load preview loop points as loops instead of WAV cue slices {#sample-browser-loop-load}
  by: codex
  from: agent

## decisions

- Sample browser confirmation and cancellation run on a one-shot timer after keyboard dispatch; pending requests freeze navigation and are cancelled when the song is released.
- Shift–Enter imports the selected folder's directly contained loadable files, alphabetically, into separate instruments using the existing empty-target selection rules; unhandled keys pass through to Renoise.

